{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:5425ef0c3679d76887c66c492e9fa07081382060e81cc88d33d67cd61459114c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8d9899cd62cd7cf6ebd52e1ad0d50755b43fe4947c1bf96e87b4eca93d7d07b",
      "text": "尚未见过的景色",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:054617feebb6b647cdfbe00dc0f9835e5cefcc9f29181b456b5714429b6028cf",
      "text": "为了避雨而走进咖啡馆的\n制作人，在那里与翼相遇。\n看着害怕打雷的翼，制作人忍不住\n担心起来，然而在开始用餐的\n瞬间，翼的气场却为之一变……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_a:cmd-000011:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_a:cmd-000011:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8d9899cd62cd7cf6ebd52e1ad0d50755b43fe4947c1bf96e87b4eca93d7d07b",
      "text": "尚未见过的景色",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a74f9405a9f3ed8c43b122121512d5e905d012dcd2abe74caeb0ce866bb4d324",
      "text": "……这么说来，您昨天成功发掘了\n在酒吧偶遇的那位人士是吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:259cba881ac0468ebb40487f59f4ccdda55edff80088f3ab7fc25b294ee9d406",
      "text": "是的。那位叫天道辉先生，\n总之就是整个人充满了热情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78e424edd6a62638f660877092198e2141a8b22d6b44162f03a0bcc88b1ae908",
      "text": "如果是他，毫无疑问具备了\n让粉丝们绽放笑容的资质！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf478f0b406ad666a8e6773ef34f74e3a09cf769b0c503759f5cd380a79cf98",
      "text": "那真令人期待呢！\n我也想早点见见他。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:109401f6ea281a5cd9036575dcb625dbfec017bcd8c3c228f79f126866ac9955",
      "text": "……不过，真的没问题吗？\n听刚才所说的，他当时好像喝得相当醉呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61fc84f15d162bca5234beb856885059f768ea67ec96298217d4422d518a176c",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー说的话，\n他有好好记住吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00205463b62a23f9f886bb87d6c7fa60597eff9cecde8a8a3345a24860f7669e",
      "text": "确实，如果要说有令人担心的地方，\n也就只有这一点了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a66a7ceba9593bdc707f52d5572edff6ae8904faf15f4ae6d2252acdecb0d72",
      "text": "但我觉得应该没问题。\n名片也留下了，而且……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d73ff335888258f4441de82300c27dcbb017ea477373d5ec408130fa4935fe44",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47cb4d43db9756d1f02ca54e704a85960b62f7a9b6f070ce11cdfd544d301f15",
      "text": "不，下起雨来了……\n我稍微避避雨再回事务所。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f7f0b8f9b49c1a62398e4d805248285ec7c4f123c84c0f89b235b3f9bdbd333",
      "text": "好的，我知道了。\n路上请小心哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6d2f1315fc7e80bd397d1fa2a56de491427349ec78990cb53d8ce5a487e4b01",
      "text": "（哪里有合适的地方呢……\n好，去那边的咖啡馆休息一下吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dfa7aa730b4b98c57af3b40163f064683c769ffab00688d797b0e87be21dca7e",
      "text": "（总觉得天气变差了啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80af3939b97b51e7eaff5e63bd938ab567fe337eb29b1d1874f7dd5bf12b17e1",
      "text": "（正好肚子也饿了，\n找个地方吃午饭吧……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:efd7c12cd0b38c658b595ea21391a3dc31c143721ebb3b008885a36ecc374ec6",
      "text": "（……\n每天每天，都像这样漫无目的地消磨时间）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbcb8aa11868bebe9da5b8f25d3977533b00f4f16efafa34cb08ef9b6dba2871",
      "text": "（仅仅受挫了一次而已，\n我到底还要消沉到什么时候啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_b:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81a71523c10f893ea8d4895f5c0a6259818fa4174b86956fe981632573a51984",
      "text": "……沙沙……达都没看吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_b:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2535c8ef7477e4521c89d59b40cd8606ed961769e568fa5106a5561765756e5b",
      "text": "……你在干什么！！换我来！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_b:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6f004a8a4145990ffe5ddd6713c8144bb1269562004216dbb92a8ada323233a",
      "text": "……啊，是咖啡馆。\n菜单看起来也很好吃。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_b:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b34c191f6ad6757b688bbaf3717b1f83dad20789df8000b84fffbc5d7b577c2",
      "text": "好，吃得饱饱的……打起精神来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_c:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_c:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf119ffb9fe85ba69a315e601f3c3b3d758d59e9e586e3d79b2becf3a76dd699",
      "text": "（雨不仅没停，甚至开始打雷了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b442012aa86948f7e68b532d3601e2f7e32eee6097f2d48258ecf6f3e0b5b12b",
      "text": "哇啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f7a363040632aa644d070232b5fbe9fa663f2d06a124b3b40c7542c7fcd80cd",
      "text": "（……刚才的声音好大啊。\n旁边的人似乎也吓了一大跳）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_c:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad53108a99ebffd0ac89e8331996e03dd6347ad9d52ea0144cf61f511529ca93",
      "text": "哇，又劈下来了……\n呜呜，果然还是习惯不了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_c:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ee745b65ccd3c2ee1b02674fa93071d3425af44c903e7171c9d1b4ad08ccb2b",
      "text": "（害怕打雷吗？\n看起来很害怕的样子……咦，那是？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_c:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb7cd2cd85bce922856b72a5cbab76b14fa78904c689583ae426e6c9e58b8714",
      "text": "让您久等了。\n这是您的蛋包饭和三明治。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_c:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc818ed937cfe4d0c564796617cf6591a357c5689f5eb4320e32d308907c1a82",
      "text": "啊，非常感谢！\n……那么，我不客气了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_c:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9c2eca5fd662aca7988661601852fe9a4dc7f196db57c67b90067c0add41916",
      "text": "嗯——，真好吃！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_d:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98c7678a340f8aa54a3bbf517cae88065276977b005779af361e450c6e3cf1e4",
      "text": "三明治……真好吃！\n分量也足，嗯——好幸福……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ece0b79338b9467f311eb3400dc37d9fdb9a3dd702dd23c7ca3dab32755be097",
      "text": "（那些菜，他一个人全吃得下吗？\n看分量感觉像是两三人的份）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_d:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27800f670348ae4a49ba97eb2a4241a56c1eeb38c0ee1a508c1a2fb1a10b2b66",
      "text": "啊，服务员。\n不好意思，麻烦再加一份拿坡里意面。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_d:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5025b9cf7d0c35cc92258954c68a6ce9ee6ba1783c3232c46f2808b16a1dca9d",
      "text": "（……诶！居然还要再加一份拿坡里意面！？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_d:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a95cc6cc8b1dfc479d3df656f5cbf80baf9a904c8103b591bc0aa516ed1e2f93",
      "text": "对了，饭后甜点选什么好呢。\n每种蛋糕看起来都很好吃……啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_d:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7db3f25970a94ee059ed826277b87a9d22131bc5d04701e1a1b0b041f09d41f9",
      "text": "“3种披萨套餐”，这个也想吃！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_d:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8772084efa69a7a3b95c9e51e30bf3e33d541c8a40c46845014a7b1639b6f2e0",
      "text": "可是，总是叫店员的话，\n稍微有点不好意思呢。唔——……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_d:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3354c3ea6f0954863e18b171dcee0d5f54d87dfc1294e06777c488c9623c0430",
      "text": "可是，好想吃！……不好意思——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_d:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c97ab794efad110308046c21aad467213c1c116e460d169bd5a25e20db76298d",
      "text": "（好幸福的笑容啊。和刚才害怕时的反差，\n简直判若两人……好！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_d:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30093ead20d3f09511057fb5a29eaa81e9e43e7ca1b2b7bc8d2d802341156b57",
      "text": "那个，打扰您用餐真是不好意思。\n能稍微占用您一点时间聊两句吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_e:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb080f7a784796a06053b45d338ee8a5899f56831ea8c475054ddf5b6feb54cf",
      "text": "诶，我吗？\n那个，我们以前在哪儿见过吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_e:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:470704f96abae23cf09150973b7db480d8756b8cf656a623905edb1586001868",
      "text": "啊，没有，初次见面。\n我是这家公司的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_e:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c98169e337284dc3cfded253d88a58debf1f67ff4e3e4eb2f1e4348407f6aab",
      "text": "315、Production？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_e:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c08c54fa790c904737e7ddd5aef48b1adb5bfa49426340ca1fcde484550f38d4",
      "text": "是的。我在那家事务所\n担任偶像制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2cbaca1a845d14071f2e04e9cf5091472507b8246d05040d55fc10c7fe5114b",
      "text": "偶像的，制作人……\n啊，我是柏木翼。请多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_e:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f839ffd5a8d7dbfa62cdd84af492c91171d4d4afe415573a2b853970982f7b39",
      "text": "那么……偶像事务所的人，\n找我有什么事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_e:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2ecb5b5b3c8ef5f99cab16064255fa8e1bad4af04c51773afe4a070d27cb886",
      "text": "其实，我想问问您\n对偶像有没有兴趣。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4bce2bd35edbe91b11e1d5a03758b296257a8ae26a7f873f24329f880c72675",
      "text": "诶……对偶像，有兴趣……？\n这难不成是说，要发掘我吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_e:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:637231e871b5a547b970a5e7df2a4c0125da8a0925ec3d1785efad7dff2474da",
      "text": "可是我什么都没做吧？\n根本没什么值得让您感兴趣的地方啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d85f1337f6a6cf52055a48151e28c1c6feb41947a6e356e53c3d43d2c4510099",
      "text": "不，刚才您用餐时的表情，是那种能让在旁看着的\n人也感到幸福的笑容。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_e:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18bd099144d3285659c61cd4243352dda828757a79b30d8b9a68f27168c7becf",
      "text": "我认为那样的笑容，正是偶像所需的资质！\n如果可以的话，能听我多说两句吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_f:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6410537dc31eeec14107b3689a9595a65a83cbf05d5cb1b3d32e4b49e8011b20",
      "text": "诶，笑容吗？\n能被这么夸奖我很高兴，但是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_f:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15ceabde6325b6f8102c55401fc8d455a85305b579576b8789b8c926b920af9f",
      "text": "我根本就不是当偶像的料啦。\n光是块头大，显眼得不行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_f:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e419d6b715427b5938b88cc44abea2789cf0c2e3deb699ab9e16aba57755bc3c",
      "text": "与其选我这样的，\n去找更帅气的男生比较好吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_f:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7f0ddfc92da00305d41c8bd3112cc612724a38ff76036087667acdcc300577d",
      "text": "突如其来的一番话，\n吓到您了非常抱歉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_f:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51ab1c712930eec41a24a37d2da65f03ecb43bfb9618cafd7d76f873f40f0936",
      "text": "什么时候答复都可以，\n首先能请您先考虑一下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_f:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35b9953381ba18a9786091d37983f2171418f74593b8f3853b9268560065246f",
      "text": "既然您这么说的话……我明白了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_f:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcab8f8852bf707fd46876e86649fe324ad0158696c57eebed78f1f8ffea143f",
      "text": "总之，我回去考虑一晚。\n答复等到明天可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_f:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4c9e638d69a298d54cb17536ff9708fe36a1eaceb60684b0932a72afc7374c1",
      "text": "嗯，没问题的！\n非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_f:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d27117b815824d97e7f765553c1ba1e5d28f7cc8dbc0a3deb1016174bd913ad2",
      "text": "我平时在机场工作，\n明天应该也在那里。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_f:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a528c5803b0ec9870ec5aaa4eccaf3a374ae39af5ee698ef04fcf06cbb8fb76",
      "text": "要是不嫌弃我的话，到时再聊吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_g:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481",
      "text": "翌日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_g:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c81e6584c644c5199abebbd7f57f9ad3b3870961371addbda7ddfbf47e614a34",
      "text": "（机场真大啊。翼先生在哪里呢……哎，那是？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_g:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0debc9da8dbb95ea21ae5cd35fea5b170dabc73f34834fe3c63a9419e571f25e",
      "text": "（这张大海报上印着的，是翼先生。\n虽然写着“舒适的空中之旅”，但是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_g:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac86f608be398514d86651b4c9136a850da2a2e0649c89a42e0fa0d65c706fd2",
      "text": "飞行员制服，加上这句台词……\n原来在机场工作，是指这么一回事啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_g:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e3971026097ebcd7700f8b5402e404b6a7e9eb0d57a8b72945a68b598c02fca",
      "text": "你好，翼先生。\n今天非常感谢您能抽出时间。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_g:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3ca7866b8564878f8459fa5845085d193f10317a888f007e09bbaaa7ba54889",
      "text": "不，没事的。今天正好轮休……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_g:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a18056be028087d2f21f192e6cba00b1b3fc2db93d572a439ff0a26ba7c72cb",
      "text": "妈妈，你看！\n又有飞机飞走啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_g:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28560bebc5480f622127f0fc612fb972b9ac20358df5380b04534802aad62740",
      "text": "天空亮闪闪的好漂亮啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_g:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c8a275e6c81201480f886549f316472e4caedcd2d20ac74eb71dde0738915ed",
      "text": "……我也像那个孩子一样，\n非常喜欢从这里能看到的天空。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_g:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a441b574d1d437ea1315ca2cd22332764db6029eecbb75439b3c8ce2bc19fbe9",
      "text": "甚至到了即使放假，也会忍不住跑来机场的程度。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_g:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98d77fcaca463bfb9c7e7f5bd3ec4f78e0a4a65b1e08c73ac11ba346bd29e08c",
      "text": "眺望着无边无际广阔的天空，\n总觉得内心能够平静下来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_g:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f20778101e1c5c260664aae7a1fec602ef94ff474deaf1408aaee8427166acc0",
      "text": "所以……如果要和您谈重要的事情，\n或许选在这个地方是最好的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_h:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94a8f60af8e8c2616340149859765bd5c2bf302a19676c5af61418b7062af2cd",
      "text": "翼先生真的很喜欢天空呢。\n就像昨天那样，露出了非常棒的表情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_h:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb7efb73d709a66d5947f7a2a8a828fc1575749783a297ecc1c0b591008f2171",
      "text": "难道说，是因为这个原因\n才成为飞行员的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_h:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7df437928627c57291bd2a55bac16ce8ac8a7511e9e27d5e47217f166861985b",
      "text": "诶？您怎么知道我是飞行员……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_h:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e24809050f1961d64f5c1dc759cd770e52d50a36ffe5538f291d65a13e61f6c8",
      "text": "刚才看到了海报，\n上面印着穿着飞行员制服的翼先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_h:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abf519cf74fe39a5cb55e1bf711bbd7b79770248b9e5104b030e12e8d765b87e",
      "text": "啊哈哈……您看到那张海报了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_h:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:824039604c46ec99b92ff8b5eb3a86d3fde9caaf060e34add8b5f441f16363a1",
      "text": "确切地说，我还只是飞行员的候补生。\n还在见习，也就是在以成为飞行员为目标的阶段。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_h:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80ebba49caa0e67db0ba28c5445573e44164660e79eb5ad0966aea6d9645d0c0",
      "text": "即使这样，我觉得也已经足够厉害了！\n竟然能被选为公司的海报形象。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_h:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1749b2e403ed486913e24bcd3490de927c37efc3a5846c0788bb31b203465499",
      "text": "谢谢您。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_h:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b688e58a4a22dab1a62c18f8a6a1a8ba76fa40a2a937e8a742a9a1122bc9ca88",
      "text": "……是啊，\n大家都对我抱有期待。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_h:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:145c57b702667b2253165c068eeb7f7bee9fe4ba00bcc156ca4fc94418a48177",
      "text": "被别人说什么“成为最年轻机长也不是梦”，\n还作为公司的形象招牌被广泛报道。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_h:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b354f7ddda45240c3662d47bb25060ba5dba6f928299d289b1157de78af2d93",
      "text": "……不过，那个梦想好像也快要结束了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_i:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:717349b5739b72fe788d8a36a370b6d7964d6dc296846f3a00f2875cc812fc0f",
      "text": "大概，我再也无法\n驾驶飞机了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_i:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:201138b170f20c6ab015ed4d681f6d0775b092411ad6917f9dd4cc04df45de4d",
      "text": "没看气象雷达吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_i:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9552dc1ee0117daeac09e1fc5e634a15badb0370adaa0c0664e0edaca0d1ca9f",
      "text": "你在干什么！！换我来！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_i:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1c467295ff5958c8d169a9ee48ead9abc26b3ba0fe1c93a8c96d27d784095dd",
      "text": "啊……啊啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_i:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fb4f4fa92c7aabd9d61a67a9c29519b8bca4059aa4873a0f0e31c2da52d47eb",
      "text": "……在大家的期待中迎来的\n第一次飞行，我就栽了个大跟头。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_i:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4ef393e54e10bd88b5fa4367c0eac62095d880b1d2a25e31b4d109f7ed4ec83",
      "text": "受到颠簸气流的影响，\n即使机舱内陷入了恐慌……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_i:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:740c5677200fcd613c5810a905b7e07f71f9d4da3adf3ad350cc2730d1852bd3",
      "text": "我却只能跟着大家\n一起手足无措。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_i:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:727c55626ee4746814e68f9d8b9e383efdf67fc4d2e367fc31222a3835aed120",
      "text": "到了现在，我连进驾驶舱都觉得害怕。\n明明从小时候起，就那么憧憬天空。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_i:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4436100cf3c1765ad367268410f344798dc83ad2b04629447bd91dab40c036fb",
      "text": "很逊吧，\n追逐梦想，有一两次失败不是家常便饭吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_i:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:215eabd259fe2c7317519822522392295d0bc73b20b220d0439b670d4aa7c5c0",
      "text": "可是，我却连跨过去的勇气都没有。\n一直只是像这样，在这个地方胆怯而已……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_i:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60a7e2381694f26bf7ce0ec052ad04f6680737d0d6def0eff36178d5c441e85b",
      "text": "没有那回事。\n那种经历任谁都不可能马上振作起来的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_i:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24f5b75615c96015e153a612bdbe87b69e14e7183a48941d6a9989bc7a9a7017",
      "text": "……谢谢您。没能回应大家的期待，\n固然十分惭愧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_i:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ddd6ade1199d6a592c3187e2a2ef8de51434ba5d6e188b279713c0cde9a68ede",
      "text": "但最重要的是，再也无法在心爱的天空翱翔，\n才是最让我寂寞的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_j:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1328625a954a71445eea6746de584b63551132a4f59093a47c12b162337f4eff",
      "text": "……翼先生。听了您刚才的话，我更加\n想要发掘您了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_j:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ff40c60c49ad969ade731b2fe244bd4b4eab9fe6adf47e06e329aad0e6c56ce",
      "text": "虽然并非作为飞行员，\n但您愿意和我一起去见识美丽的景色吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_j:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:891a3a54d75d91a7a8051ddf55f87fd988c6dd5291f25c51a2280091d70c3153",
      "text": "美丽的景色，吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_j:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56318a7c19ccf12f7850cf13156327247f3cb23a4c9986370c9495db644a4ef4",
      "text": "是的！成为偶像后，\n从舞台之上看到的景色。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_j:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef11194b37b5d25310c329a60e5de55d538ee2487caaf87c529373d6b93d6019",
      "text": "荧光棒的光辉，以及充满笑容的观众席，\n我认为是绝不输给天空的最棒景色。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_j:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7ef08edf95a095304565530deb2850238242557bced09536c13d64ee41f56df",
      "text": "翼先生的话，一定能够\n到达那样的景色的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_j:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd248b6b7097861e7c6c458c182b4e6336f57e8030b99856dfdea3bda7421b8e",
      "text": "……被您说到这个份上，不由得有点在意了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_j:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:531d837e32272a29598959e2d5db1e8ddb3f6f3abd577fb29026e90750809875",
      "text": "如果真有那样的地方，我也想看一看。\n从舞台之上看到的，最棒的景色……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_j:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a1805f9d383b298456f40fbce1af4ad0c3d2dea18ee6a5a7d5da89a0fdf94af",
      "text": "这也是某种缘分吧，\n●●●●●●●●●●。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_j:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed30b7570c477d79d216bdfb13a4ca715c12f03aa5f99a23918e3f32964fa8e9",
      "text": "我，想和您一起再次\n朝向梦想起飞！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
